  "source_sha256": "c7ca566e7702d2c6f6fa09f3c22b19ff7597c9eb2d7dc97cf32f982404b76bb4",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f81b497dcac9312274ae99d8463184e41e545fa11d8d000edaf27a877f6f9cae",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nPainting Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fab08dc75c82c0044602059fad3762b26d099318aed9ee69862363a0549f4ab3",
      "text": "“What will you paint?”\nasked the teacher.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "71c0237036e2dc7bc42f145541b8742ae1e36ac3d550d4ba92ea331ace5c7d85",
      "text": "“A unicorn!” said Nezha.\n“Mine will have rainbow hair!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b4273eb94350ac9574af5d7365d5c158a633099b57f89fe1a65da9c8e7a575e5",
      "text": "“A bunny,” said Pigsy.\n“Look at these long ears!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "50902d8dd310c640cb19b5405309b0ede3742402afeb1fc9cf1261f4ac48636d",
      "text": "“A unicorn for me, too!”\nsaid Wukong.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "44e55522d2590dd00a9eee6f27b700606652fa8cb47601af63438e4be36f18e6",
      "text": "He mixed red and blue.\nHe mixed in yellow.\nSwish, swish, swish.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2a718f8e2dace5fdfca6b78020fd5cff62f42bb8247386c757fa684c2a5ce384",
      "text": "Wukong looked at his paper.\n“My unicorn is\na round brown blob!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "55db59c989d8b843913a46dc3de92ab0ba43e54f5088a7dc2011095080de1861",
      "text": "The teacher looked, too.\n“What can that blob be?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d18c9446f1b7d95afbb39db8823e004284f2e1139c3b7a0adcb1260dab87e87e",
      "text": "He painted two round ears.\nThe blob was a bear!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9376e5a5d20c282f18a1c787c098160ba5ebb3e96fc80ebf0911d60b60eeaf19",
      "text": "Two eyes. One nose.\nA happy little smile.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7bae8beeeeaa1b0941b437b429b52c4f8f37b321e694171a07cce73af1bb36e5",
      "text": "Nezha painted rainbow hair.\nPigsy painted pink\ninside the bunny’s ears.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5aae2411d759e9807b69a6dae499cb2ef07eb805feb6d226dc93b2aad32deb72",
      "text": "“Can we paint together?”\n“Yes!” said his friends.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "26f9a57e4b530b7bfdb39e3478bf795c31a89f671094429620d5de9a5be54975",
      "text": "They painted green grass.\nThey painted a little path.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fa30f8e9d16d0e4e9087f4b08019c7f305631866f19f6ed604a32b58440e34a3",
      "text": "Wukong painted a pillow\nby his bear.\n“Painting is hard work!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ece281d60794bd3fa352634ec49e5910a6fc1bab745a0918c7d983c314c8f5c2",
      "text": "They washed their brushes.\nThey put up their picture.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6bade434541445698cf48407f4af84235b0f0dc76d9aca835178b238f16fba4c",
      "text": "“We made this together!”\nsaid Wukong.\n“Sleep well, little bear.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
